            "review_text": "LarsHansen\nAarhus18 contributions\n1\nBe aware: Average food, bad service and faulty bill\nFeb 2019 • Family\nThe place was cozy, but the service was extremely poor and the waitress was arrogant. We did not receive all the food we ordered, but the food we actually did get was average - the chicken was chewy, and probably from a hen. Finally, the bill contained items we had not received. We can NOT recommend this restaurant!\n\nWe visited Truc Linh 2 and ordered 4 cocktails to start with before dinner together with 4 starters, and 4 main courses. We got the main courses first, 2 minutes later the cocktails and 1 minute later the starters.\nOne of the main courses was not as described in the menu card. We did not want that incorrect main course, but was told that we should have asked what was included in the course before ordering it. The waitress denied to change the incorrect course, but was told by another employee to do so. However, she did not bring the course and did not react on the reminders.\nWhen we received the bill we were charged for 4 main course and 2 extra bottles of water. When the waitress was confronted with the faulty bill, she said that it had been a very busy evening (even though the restaurant had only been half full).\nWe asked to talk to the manager, but was told by the waitress that he was home sleeping. We said we would come back the next day to talk to the manager, but then we were informed that the manager was on vacation. When asking for a deputy for the manager, we were now told that the manager was in another restaurant far away. After she said that she suddenly did not understand English.\nAll in all, the place was cozy, but then service was extremely poor and the food was average - the chicken was chewy, and probably from a hen.\nSurely, we can NOT recommend this restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 11, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
