            "review_text": "patrick v\nMelbourne, Australia23 contributions\n0\nfirst night in Nha Trang\nAug 2018 • Couples\nI visited Truc Linh 2 restaurant in Nha Trang for the first time,when we arrived we were greeted by friendly helpful staff,we ordered the chicken with ginger,fried rice and vegetables,prawns and oysters,it was all really delicious and tasty,and the service was great ,and they gave us a small bowl of freshly cooked local eel as a sampler,which was very kind of them,a really good local dining experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 9, 2018",
