            "review_text": "KPR1955\nDeeside, United Kingdom1833 contributions\n0\nEnd of a long day maybe?\nJun 2018 • Friends\nWe visited here on a group tour and had just travelled from Ho Chi Minh City via other stops en route. \nThe setting here was pretty good, we had a balcony table with a nice breeze blowing. We were only a small group so we could all sit together.\nWe had a set menu and therefore had no issues around choice, the food was good, the menu was a decent blend, but I think also our tiredness must have rubbed off on the staff as they seemed to give the impression that they would rather be somewhere else.\nThe pity is that a smile and/or a happy face actually costs nothing and really adds to the setting. However it was not to be.\nThe restaurant also provided vegetarian dishes for some companions who prefer that menu. all the food tasted fine, there was no particular speciality on our set menu and so struggle to find anything that elevates this to more than average.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 22, 2018",
