            "review_text": "KY28\nSingapore, Singapore186 contributions\n0\nAverage seafood\nMay 2018 • Couples\nWent there for dinner the evening we arrived in Nha Trang. It was in the neighbourhood of our apartment. The food is average at best and the prices are on the high side for the quality of the food.\n\nMy personal opinion is that when a restaurant caters to a lot of tour groups, one cannot expect the quality to be good. While we were there there were at least 8-10 groups of tourists, brought there by their guides. These groups range from 6 to more than 10. \n\nI won't go back again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 30, 2018",
